# Copy this file to .env and fill in the keys you have.
# The router skips any provider whose key is missing — the pipeline still
# runs as long as at least one provider in each role's chain has a key.
# Free limits and data terms below are from each provider's own pages (checked 2026-09-30).

# aistudio.google.com — no card required (also used for memory's embeddings)
GOOGLE_API_KEY=

# build.nvidia.com — no card required
NVIDIA_API_KEY=

# openrouter.ai — no card required; only ":free" model ids are used (others bill credits)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# console.groq.com/keys — no card required. Free plan, per organization: e.g. openai/gpt-oss-120b
# 30 req/min, 1,000 req/day, 200K tokens/day (console.groq.com/docs/rate-limits).
# "By default, Groq does not retain customer data for inference requests" (console.groq.com/docs/your-data).
GROQ_API_KEY=

# cloud.cerebras.ai — NOT USED: sign-up asks for a credit card (checked 2026-09-30), which the free-only
# rule rules out. For reference: Free Trial = $5 of credits that expire after 30 days; 5 req/min, 1M tokens/day
# (inference-docs.cerebras.ai/support/rate-limits). "We do not retain inputs and outputs associated with our
# ... inference ... Services" (cerebras.ai/privacy-policy).
# CEREBRAS_API_KEY=

# console.mistral.ai — free mode with the lowest limits (see admin.mistral.ai/plateforme/limits).
# On the free plan Mistral "may use your data (input and output) to train" its models unless you opt out:
# Admin panel -> Privacy -> "Anonymous improvement data" (help.mistral.ai/en/articles/455207).
MISTRAL_API_KEY=

# cloud.sambanova.ai — NOT USED: its docs describe a free tier (20 req/min, 20 req/day, 200K tokens/day per
# model, docs.sambanova.ai/docs/en/models/rate-limits), but on 2026-09-30 this account's key got
# "402 A payment method is required" on every model. "SambaCloud never sees or collects any of your data
# or user prompts" (sambanova.ai/products/sambacloud).
SAMBANOVA_API_KEY=

# dash.cloudflare.com (Workers Free plan, no card) -> AI -> Workers AI -> "Use REST API": create a token
# and copy the account id. Free: 10,000 Neurons/day (~146K output tokens on gpt-oss-120b); some frontier
# models (GLM 5.2/5.3, DeepSeek) need a paid plan (developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/platform/pricing).
# Cloudflare "does not use customer content to train any AI models" (developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/platform/data-usage).
CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY=
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=

# z.ai/model-api — GLM-4.7-Flash and GLM-4.5-Flash are priced "Free" (docs.z.ai/guides/overview/pricing).
# For the API, Z.ai processes customer data "only on the Customer's behalf for the purpose of providing
# and supporting API Services" (docs.z.ai/legal-agreement/privacy-policy).
ZAI_API_KEY=

# ollama.com/settings/keys — free account with starter usage on a smaller set of cloud models, hourly and
# weekly limits (ollama.com/pricing). "We do not use them [cloud prompts and responses] to train models"
# (docs.ollama.com/cloud).
OLLAMA_API_KEY=

# GitHub Models (GITHUB_API_KEY) was retired on 2026-07-30 — "The playground, model catalog, inference API,
# and bring your own key (BYOK) are no longer available" (docs.github.com/en/github-models), so it isn't used.
